{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633760/extras/219865b26897d2b3627dcae11ef91c72.poster.avif?t=1764941756\" width=1170 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633760/extras/219865b26897d2b3627dcae11ef91c72.webm?t=1764941756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633760/extras/219865b26897d2b3627dcae11ef91c72.mp4?t=1764941756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fastest roguelike game on earth! KAZ pushes you to dash, react, and score to the next level in this psychedelic, action-packed, chaotic arcade roguelike game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633760/extras/c7bd19e3d20e73a3c8f4b2b818055f4e.poster.avif?t=1764941756\" width=1170 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633760/extras/c7bd19e3d20e73a3c8f4b2b818055f4e.webm?t=1764941756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633760/extras/c7bd19e3d20e73a3c8f4b2b818055f4e.mp4?t=1764941756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is not for the slowpoke fingers! This is a 4-button game that leaves no excuses as you progress round by round with flashy visuals to fuel that dopamine hit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633760/extras/dfb053a96031f9392eae309a07e542b8.poster.avif?t=1764941756\" width=1170 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633760/extras/dfb053a96031f9392eae309a07e542b8.webm?t=1764941756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633760/extras/dfb053a96031f9392eae309a07e542b8.mp4?t=1764941756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rounds last for only up to 20 seconds as you expand grid maps, increase enemy spawns, and encounter \u201cgotcha\u201d traps. Each match progresses you to higher scores, and unlocks more items and themes to help you all the way through the infinite endgame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633760/extras/7354de893a85994d050367986b232d52.poster.avif?t=1764941756\" width=1170 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633760/extras/7354de893a85994d050367986b232d52.webm?t=1764941756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633760/extras/7354de893a85994d050367986b232d52.mp4?t=1764941756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The right combination of tons of items, boosts, spells, and consumables will be the difference between your early exit or reaching the endless number of rounds that get crazier, flashier, and downright ridiculous! Do not underestimate maluses as they can provide hidden power-ups along the way, but the wrong one could spell an early repeat to round one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633760/extras/fbc4ec36194e86e0e8eb9ad233cd07b4.poster.avif?t=1764941756\" width=1170 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633760/extras/fbc4ec36194e86e0e8eb9ad233cd07b4.webm?t=1764941756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633760/extras/fbc4ec36194e86e0e8eb9ad233cd07b4.mp4?t=1764941756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your fast finger twitch reaction time deserves to be seen! Top the leader boards and share with your friends just how fast you are, and who knows, you might win special rewards now and then as one of the quickest fingers around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3633760?t=1764941756","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3633760?t=1764941756","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633760/7547c4de9698e076c51aeef53eff81352ac087fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764941756","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633760/7547c4de9698e076c51aeef53eff81352ac087fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764941756","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3705890,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_im